1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,781
Five things not to do in Madagascar.
The last one surprises tourists.

2
00:00:06,001 --> 00:00:09,819
Don't drink the tap water.
It can spread typhoid and hepatitis A.

3
00:00:11,339 --> 00:00:15,828
Don't drive between cities after dark.
Armed robberies happen on main roads.

4
00:00:17,348 --> 00:00:21,647
Don't join demonstrations. Roads shut
down, and clashes can turn violent.

5
00:00:23,167 --> 00:00:26,407
Don't flash wealth. Thieves
look for visible valuables.

6
00:00:27,927 --> 00:00:32,427
Don't ignore the fady. Breaking one
is believed to bring misfortune.

7
00:00:32,447 --> 00:00:36,880
Ask: Inona no fady eto? Never
photograph a tomb without permission.
